From: macos15-guest-stack <kirin@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] draw: do not refuse a seedless DontCare colour load

The native-load seed path refused every colour load whose format needs a
native seed (or whose mip level is non-zero) and whose target_gva is set,
because the seed request and the elision reseed are both logged refusals
upstream.  That is the typed answer for a Load, which promised prior
contents this device cannot produce - but a DontCare promised nothing:
undefined contents are the contract, so it must fall through seedless and
let the pass key resolve to Color0Load::Undefined (DONT_CARE), exactly
like a seedless DontCare in any other format.

On the driven macos-15 GUI boot every one of the 1 471
draw_prepare_native_load_seed_unavailable refusals was a DontCare, and
each refused draw left its fence outstanding.

Apply on top of 0003 in the reims-vgpu source root:  patch -p1 < this file

diff --git a/crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/vulkan.rs b/crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/vulkan.rs
index c5cbd4a1..5d04e022 100644
--- a/crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/vulkan.rs
+++ b/crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/vulkan.rs
@@ -8589,8 +8589,24 @@ fn try_metal2vulkan_draw<M: HostMemory + HostOps>(
                         }
                         seed_door = "native_color_seed";
                         target_native_seed = Some(seed.clone());
-                    } else if c0.target_gva != 0
+                    } else if matches!(declared, LoadAction::Load)
+                        && c0.target_gva != 0
                         && (native_seed::requires_native(c0.format) || c0.guest_mip_level != 0) {
+                        // A LOAD promised prior contents this device cannot
+                        // produce: the request builder attempted the seed and
+                        // the elision reseed, and both are logged refusals
+                        // upstream. Refusing is the typed answer to that
+                        // genuinely inconsistent state. A DontCare that
+                        // reaches here promised nothing - undefined contents
+                        // are the contract - so it falls through with no
+                        // seed and the pass key resolves to
+                        // `Color0Load::Undefined` (`DONT_CARE`), exactly like
+                        // a seedless DontCare in any other format. Refusing
+                        // one of those drops a draw the guest is entitled to
+                        // have run: on the driven macos-15 GUI boot every one
+                        // of the 1 471 `draw_prepare_native_load_seed_unavailable`
+                        // refusals was a DontCare, and each refused draw left
+                        // its fence outstanding.
                         crate::observe::fail(format!(
                             "native_color_load_seed reason=required_seed_unavailable task={} ref={} gva={:#x} format={:#x}",
                             req.task_id, c0.texture_ref, c0.target_gva, c0.format,
